	(text "U505 clears latch U506 when VBAT_PROT < 9.62-10.40 V or DevKit EN is low (RESET); latch on +3V3.\nOnly a rising Schmitt edge (U507) of the SW501 node arms it; GPIO10 via R518 cannot. CLK/CLR via\nSchmitt buffers U507/U508. ACT_ARMED -> Q407 (ServoPower), ACT_DISARMED -> U204 (Actuators)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
