	(text "LOCK_SUP 5.0 V from VBAT_PROT (R520, D507) powers both supervisors: no rail is needed to lock.\nU515: +3V3 < 3.024-3.116 V, U516: +5V < 4.21-4.55 V -> RAILS_OK low (wired AND, R523) -> Q507 on\n-> OUT_LOCK = LOCK_SUP: Q408 (ServoPower) holds RUN low, Q206 (Actuators) holds ESC_DRV low,\nU204 (Actuators) puts U201 Hi-Z. Release only with both rails valid + 12-28 ms. Safety uses only\nON states (guaranteed VOL, RDS(on)); OFF leakage only delays the release. Proven while D507 regulates (VBAT_PROT >= 6.86 V); below: docs 3.20."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
